srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1679021/7887c399-23a0-40fd-8b6a-9de4310b5ffe.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Entire apartment\nHigh-quality furnished 4-room apartment in a quiet and green residential area of Bonn-Brüser Berg – ideal for a temporary stay without any administrative hassle.  The apartment offers approx. 104 m2 of living space and is rented fully furnished and all-inclusive for a period of 3 to 9 months. The monthly flat rent includes all utilities, electricity, internet, and furnishings.  The apartment is located on the 2nd floor (no elevator) and features a spacious living and dining area, three separate bedrooms, and two full bathrooms. The functional layout makes it particularly well suited for stays of several months.  The amenities include a large living room with smart TV, high-speed Wi-Fi, a fully equipped kitchen, washer and dryer inside the apartment, and a loggia. One of the rooms is furnished with a desk and is well suited as a home office.\n\nAdditional Information\nFeatures & Furnishings • Fully furnished (ready to move in) • 4 rooms (living/dining area, bedroom, additional rooms with flexible use) • Fitted kitchen including stove, oven, refrigerator, and dishwasher • Complete kitchen equipment (dishes, cutlery, cooking utensils) • Washer and dryer inside the apartment • Balcony / loggia  • Internet / Wi-Fi included • Flat-rate rent (all-inclusive)\n\nLocation  \nThe apartment is located at Gothastraße 10 in the Hardtberg district (Brüser Berg) of Bonn, a quiet and green residential area with excellent infrastructure. The neighborhood is characterized by well-maintained apartment buildings, green spaces, and a pleasant, established residential environment.  Shops for daily needs, bakeries, pharmacies, and medical practices are within walking distance. Schools, kindergartens, and other everyday facilities are located nearby.  Public transportation connections are very good: bus lines provide quick access to Bonn city center, the Federal District, the UN Campus, and Bonn University Hospital. The motorways A565 and A555 can be reached within minutes, offering convenient connections toward Cologne, Siegburg, and Koblenz.  The Hardtberg district also offers a high recreational value with nearby green and wooded areas, sports facilities, as well as walking and cycling paths. The location is particularly suitable for professionals, project staff, and families who value quiet living combined with good accessibility.  \n\nAdditional Information  \nThe apartment is particularly suitable for professionals, project workers, expats, or families in a transitional phase who are looking to stay in Bonn for a limited period of time.  The apartment is rented exclusively for residential purposes as a temporary accommodation. • Maximum occupancy: 4 persons • Non-smoking apartment • Pets not permitted  If you are interested, we look forward to receiving a short, non-binding message stating your preferred move-in date and rental period.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value"